<view class="page" style="{{s}}"><view class="top-bar" style="{{'padding-top:' + b}}"><text class="back-text" bindtap="{{a}}">‹ 返回</text><text class="top-title">校园饭堂</text><text class="top-placeholder"></text></view><view wx:if="{{c}}" class="hero-card" style="{{m}}"><text class="hero-title">今天想去哪家饭堂吃饭？</text><text class="hero-desc">{{d}} · {{e}}</text><text class="hero-tip">想缩小推荐范围时再勾选就好；如果不选，系统会默认全校饭堂都可推荐。</text><view class="selection-state" style="{{j}}"><view class="selection-state__head"><text class="selection-state__title">{{f}}</text><text class="selection-state__badge" style="{{h}}">{{g}}</text></view><text class="selection-state__desc">{{i}}</text></view><text class="section-title section-title--inside">饭堂列表</text><text class="section-desc">选中后，AI 会优先在这些饭堂里帮你挑更合适的菜。</text><view wx:if="{{k}}" class="canteen-list"><view wx:for="{{l}}" wx:for-item="canteen" wx:key="i" class="canteen-card press-feedback" style="{{canteen.j}}" hover-class="press-feedback--active" hover-start-time="20" hover-stay-time="90" bindtap="{{canteen.k}}"><view wx:if="{{canteen.a}}" class="canteen-card__glow" style="{{canteen.b}}"></view><view class="canteen-card__head"><view class="canteen-card__copy"><text class="canteen-name" style="{{canteen.d}}">{{canteen.c}}</text><text class="canteen-remark" style="{{canteen.f}}">{{canteen.e}}</text></view><view class="canteen-badge" style="{{canteen.h}}">{{canteen.g}}</view></view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty-card"><text class="empty-title">这所学校还没有配置饭堂数据</text><text class="empty-desc">后面接入后台后，这里会按学校自动展示对应饭堂。</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{n}}" class="action-row"><button class="clear-button press-feedback" style="{{o}}" bindtap="{{p}}">恢复默认范围</button><button class="save-button press-feedback" style="{{q}}" bindtap="{{r}}">保存选择</button></view></view>